# Startup policy: confirm HOME, then enter EDIT for this editor-oriented regression.
wait 300
expect view 0
tap EDIT
expect view 1
# Screen reader (fm1-reader, firmware/src/announce.c): silent until a reader says HELLO, then the whole screen,
# then what changes: a knob, a page, a step, play and stop, a list row with its place, a help card, a message.
# (each "said" checks what was said since the one before)
wait 300
said_none
listen
said 909. BD (1/2): TUNE 34, ATTACK 13, DECAY 80, P.DPTH 0. STEPS 1-16 ON: NONE
turn K1 3
wait 400
said BD  TUNE 37
tap EDIT
wait 400
said 909. BD (2/2): PITCH 45
tapkey w0
said STEP 1 ON
tapkey w0
said STEP 1 OFF
tap PLAY
said PLAY
tap PLAY
said STOP
tap GLO
wait 400
said GLOBAL LIST. COPY/PASTE SEQUENCES, ACTION, 1 OF 22
tap SEL
wait 400
said COPY/PASTE SEQ LIST. COPY/PASTE SEQUENCES. COPY FROM P1, 1 OF 5
turn SELECT 2
wait 400
said SOURCE PART ALL PARTS, 3 OF 5
turn ALGO 2
wait 400
said SOURCE PART 909 SNARE, 3 OF 5
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
said DEST PART 909 SNARE, 4 OF 5
turn ALGO 4
wait 400
said DEST PART 909 RIMSHOT, 4 OF 5
tap HOME
wait 400
said GLOBAL LIST. COPY/PASTE SEQUENCES, ACTION, 1 OF 22
turn SELECT 1
wait 300
said MIDI. CC MODE FULL, 2 OF 22
turn SELECT 1
wait 300
said CLOCK OUT ON, 3 OF 22
turn SELECT 1
wait 300
said NOTES OUT OFF, 4 OF 22
tap GLO
wait 300
press SAVE
wait 1200
said SAVE BUTTON. TAP: SAVE EVERYTHING
release SAVE
wait 300
where
said 909. BD (2/2): PITCH 45. STEPS 1-16 ON: NONE
